WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.676 --> 00:00:03.230
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.570
- [Narrator] This small
three-acre island is home to one

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.001
of the most cherished sea temples in Bali.

00:00:09.001 --> 00:00:11.584
(upbeat music)

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.860
Tanah Lot translates to Land in the Sea

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.420
in the Balinese language,

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.790
which perfectly describes
this rock formation

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.623
and the temple that sits atop it.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.520
It can be found along the
southwest coast of Bali

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.510
and is one of seven ocean
temples each of which

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:30.833
was built within eye line of the next.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.900
Tanah Lot was built
around the 16th century

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.810
to honor the sea spirits.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:42.020
It is believed that it is
protected by sea serpents.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:45.190
The rock base that the temple
sits on has been reconstructed

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:48.090
over time as the original
rock had begun crumbling

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:49.073
into the ocean.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.370
Visitors are able to
access the island via foot

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:54.374
during low tide.

00:00:54.374 --> 00:00:57.890
However, non Balinese
people are not permitted

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:58.983
to enter the temple.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.810
This is one of the most visited
and photographed temples

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:09.013
in Bali, and it is especially
busy at sunrise and sunset.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:13.370
Although, if you intend to
visit, don't bring a date.

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:16.010
It is believed there is a
curse on unmarried couples

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.550
who visit the temple.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:20.129
Their relationship is doomed.

00:01:20.129 --> 00:01:21.710
(upbeat music)

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:25.393
But this view might
just be worth the risk.

